       - "U4's trail carries its merged(ce05465) event, which the trail-tail route could not carry (U4 cleanup, 2026-10-23): the event is in local commit 2abcc5b on feature/ui/U4 (docs/trace/ui/U4/loop.jsonl), kept so it can be cherry-picked"
       - "Plan switcher (David 2026-10-23, U9 Pause 2: 'how do i swap to see the ui plan in docket?'): the Plan nav entry no longer always opens the build plan (src/web/app/shell/Frame.tsx:113 picks the plan of kind build). It offers every plan in trace.json (build, ui and the investigations), each opening #/plans/<id>, from kit components only, with a unit test and an e2e test that a ui plan link reaches #/plans/ui"
+      - "Trace on start (David 2026-10-23: 'Does trace need to be run when we start the project in vs if yes can we add it to u10'): the compiler writes src/Uinsure.Policies.Web/public/trace.json, which is ignored, so a fresh clone has none and Docket shows 'Could not load trace.json'. Starting the dev server (F5's Vite dev server target, the StartupCommand and npx vite) compiles the trail first, so a fresh clone opens on the trail with no manual npm run trace; a failed compile is reported in the console and the page, never a silent empty trail; tested red first"
